{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54512","headline":"兵要望江南 风角第二（辛本作「占风角第二」、京本作「占风第三」。三十三首） 三十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 风角第二（辛本作「占风角第二」、京本作「占风第三」。三十三首） 三十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临阵次（京本作「处」），风向後飘（京本作「头」）来。\n旗帜翩翩吹向敌（京本作「从敌上」），天威默助凯歌回，贼败息（京本作「悉」）尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}